					6, 1126</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">1, 307</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ubi frigidus imber Altius ad vivum persedit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 442</span></i>
			.</div>
